{"transcription": [{"offsets": {"from": 1000, "to": 6000}, "text": " Hi. Yes, I'm at the 2014 Mini Maker Faire here in Sydney."}, {"offsets": {"from": 6000, "to": 9000}, "text": " Back yet again. It's at the awesome Powerhouse Museum here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 9000, "to": 12000}, "text": " And they're setting up behind me. Sorry, it's a bit dark."}, {"offsets": {"from": 12000, "to": 14000}, "text": " I don't think they've turned on the main lights yet."}, {"offsets": {"from": 14000, "to": 17000}, "text": " But anyway, we're busy setting up. It's still early in the morning here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 17000, "to": 22000}, "text": " Doors open at 10am. So I might show you some behind-the-scenes stuff as well."}, {"offsets": {"from": 22000, "to": 25000}, "text": " It's going to be a great show. Let's have a look."}, {"offsets": {"from": 25000, "to": 29000}, "text": " And there you go. That's dedication to get into the Maker Faire for you."}, {"offsets": {"from": 29000, "to": 33000}, "text": " They're lined up in the rain. It might have actually just stopped today."}, {"offsets": {"from": 33000, "to": 38000}, "text": " But, yeah, it was pretty miserable this morning. It was bucketing down."}, {"offsets": {"from": 38000, "to": 42000}, "text": " And, yeah, they're very brave, very keen. They can't wait to get in."}, {"offsets": {"from": 59000, "to": 82000}, "text": " Yeah, they're lined up way out the door there. And they can't wait to get in."}, {"offsets": {"from": 82000, "to": 86000}, "text": " And, no, this is not opening time. This is later in the afternoon."}, {"offsets": {"from": 86000, "to": 91000}, "text": " So everyone's turned out. And we've got ourselves a nice racing car hanging from the roof there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 91000, "to": 96000}, "text": " And as you walk into the Powerhouse, there's the fantastic train. I love it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 96000, "to": 101000}, "text": " And there's some of the exhibitors right down there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 102000, "to": 120000}, "text": " Anywhere in the world. Which is the exciting, really exciting part."}, {"offsets": {"from": 120000, "to": 124000}, "text": " Surrender. Did you say? Surrender? Yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 125000, "to": 127000}, "text": " OK."}, {"offsets": {"from": 143000, "to": 147000}, "text": " Hello! Are you having fun today?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 154000, "to": 162000}, "text": " And look who I've found. Say again."}, {"offsets": {"from": 162000, "to": 166000}, "text": " Yeah, you want to see a train set?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 166000, "to": 168000}, "text": " It's a big one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 214000, "to": 216000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 244000, "to": 247000}, "text": " Oh!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 274000, "to": 296000}, "text": " And there's a familiar face. Malcolm Fade on his homemade Segway."}, {"offsets": {"from": 304000, "to": 320000}, "text": " Drive resistance is futile. Give me a wave."}, {"offsets": {"from": 334000, "to": 349000}, "text": " That's all these amazing sounds already. Guitar sounds."}, {"offsets": {"from": 349000, "to": 355000}, "text": " Maybe I'll just give you a little introduction about circuit bending."}, {"offsets": {"from": 356000, "to": 363000}, "text": " This is by Rick Gazzala. I think this might have been in the 70s."}, {"offsets": {"from": 368000, "to": 379000}, "text": " We started using these wearable Arduinos from Peterthroop and LED strips which you can imitate water sloshing around with movement."}, {"offsets": {"from": 380000, "to": 385000}, "text": " Is this for prostitutes?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 385000, "to": 387000}, "text": " Yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 399000, "to": 401000}, "text": " Yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 401000, "to": 403000}, "text": " If we get lucky."}, {"offsets": {"from": 403000, "to": 405000}, "text": " If we get lucky."}, {"offsets": {"from": 407000, "to": 409000}, "text": " If we get lucky."}, {"offsets": {"from": 433000, "to": 435000}, "text": " If 